@startuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10

title Programmatic Advertising RTB Data Flow\n(Millisecond-by-Millisecond Journey)

actor       "User"              as USER
participant "Publisher App"     as PUB
participant "BidOn\nSSP / Ad Exchange" as Bidon
participant "DSP"               as DSP
database    "DMP / CDP"         as DMP
participant "ML Engine"         as ML
participant "Ad Server / CDN"   as ADSRV
participant "Attribution /\nViewability" as ATTR
participant "Analytics\n(Kafka / RedPanda)" as ANALYTICS

== Step 1: User Activity & Initial Data Collection (1–2 ms) ==
USER -> PUB ++ : Page / app load
PUB -> PUB : Collect device, location,\nbrowser, contextual signals

== Step 2: SSP Bid Request Assembly (2–5 ms) ==
PUB -> Bidon ++ : Raw context data
Bidon -> Bidon : Assemble OpenRTB\nbid request (JSON)\n+ publisher data

== Step 3: Ad Exchange Routing & Distribution (3–7 ms) ==
Bidon -> Bidon : Lookup eligible DSPs\n(targeting preference table)
Bidon -> DSP ++ : HTTP / gRPC bid request\n(fan-out to N DSPs)

== Step 4: DSP User Profile Retrieval & Enrichment (5–15 ms) ==
DSP -> DMP ++ : Query by User ID
DMP -> DSP -- : Audience segments,\nbehavioral & 3rd-party data\n(cache → DB fallback)

== Step 5: DSP Bid Evaluation & Decision (10–25 ms) ==
DSP -> ML ++ : Feature vector\n(user profile + opportunity)
ML  -> DSP -- : Predicted conversion probability
DSP -> DSP : Match targeting criteria,\ncheck budget & pacing,\ncalculate bid price,\nselect creative

== Step 6: Ad Exchange Auction & Winner Selection (3–7 ms) ==
DSP -> Bidon -- : Bid response\n(price + creative metadata)
note over Bidon : Collects bids from all DSPs\nRuns 1st- or 2nd-price auction
Bidon -> DSP : Win / loss notification (HTTP / gRPC)

== Step 7: Ad Creative Delivery & Impression Logging (5–15 ms) ==
Bidon -> PUB -- : Winning creative URL
PUB -> ADSRV ++ : Fetch creative
ADSRV -> PUB -- : HTTP 200 + creative payload (CDN)
PUB -> ANALYTICS ++ : Impression event\n(Kafka / RedPanda)
PUB -> USER -- : Render ad

== Step 8: Attribution & Viewability Monitoring (ongoing) ==
USER -> ATTR ++ : JS tags / tracking pixels\n(impression, viewability, click)
USER -> ATTR : Conversion pixel fires\non advertiser site

== Step 9: Data Feedback Loop to DMP/CDP (near real-time, ~1 min) ==
ATTR -> DMP ++ : Aggregated impression,\nclick & conversion signals
deactivate ATTR
ANALYTICS -> DMP : Batch + streaming updates
deactivate ANALYTICS
DMP -> DMP : Update user profiles
DMP -> DSP --: Refreshed segments\n(next bidding cycle)

note over USER, ANALYTICS
  Full round-trip target: ≤ 100 ms (hard cap: 300 ms)
end note
@enduml
